      "text": "I've pulled Robot 2's (meter `mach_b2_2`) energy use for every 15 minutes of 10 September 2026, in plant local time (Europe/Rome, UTC+02:00 on that day). There are 96 rows, from 00:00 to 23:45. Each one is the kWh used in the 15 minutes starting at `bucket_start`.\n\nI built a full list of the 96 time slots and matched the readings to it, so any slot with no reading would show as null rather than disappearing. Of the 96 rows, I've only looked at the first 50 (up to 12:15), and none of those are null. I haven't checked the remaining 46.\n\nIn the morning, Robot 2 mostly uses about 5\u20138.75 kWh per slot. It drops to about 0.9\u20131.1 kWh from 03:45 to 04:45 and again at 07:30\u201307:45, with partial slots of 2.17 kWh at 05:00 and 08:00.",
